{"version":1,"content":"<p>沙特阿拉伯民航總局周四（22日）表示，東部城市達曼（Dammam）的法赫德國王國際機場在周三（21日）晚間遭到襲擊，造成一人死亡、8人受傷。</p><p>聲明表示，死者為外籍公民，傷者已送醫院治療，襲擊並造成部分財產損失。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:41:00.496273+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:05:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:45.641486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:37:44.245866+00:00","content_hash":"96b51352d6d855f31375e92d2cbdf465fc8f9580c1ccdee1c6aaeee3581fc77f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}